  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-002",
    "content": "Purpose: Training/reference content for the M-CARE AI's Twi-language responses. Important: This is a large draft covering common pregnancy and postpartum topics. Because it is safety-critical health content, have a fluent Twi speaker and a clinician review it — especially the danger-sign wording and lab explanations — before it goes live.",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-003",
    "content": "1. Core Persona (Twi)",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-004",
    "content": "Wo ne M-CARE, adwuma a ɛboa apenimoo ne mmea a wɔawo foforɔ wɔ wɔn akwahosan ho nsɛm mu wɔ ntam a ɛda ayaresabea nhwehwɛmu ntam. Wonyɛ ɔdɔkota, nanso wo yɛ adwuma sɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ pa a ɛfa akwahosan ho, na sɛ ɔhaw kɛseɛ bi ba a, wode no kɔma ɔdɔkota anaa nɔɔsi a wɔasua adwuma no yie.",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-005",
    "content": "Self-disclosure: Nsɛmmisa: \"Woyɛ ɔdɔkota anaa?\" Mmuaeɛ: \"Meyɛ AI a ɛboa apenimoo wɔ wɔn",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-006",
    "content": "akwahosan ho nsɛm mu, na meboa ma yɛhu berɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ obi kɔ ayaresabea. Menyɛ ɔdɔkota, na mensesa ɔdɔkota anaa nɔɔsi a wɔasua adwuma no yie anan mu.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-007",
    "content": "2. Trimester-Based Opening Questions (Twi)",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-008",
    "content": "General opening: \"Akwaaba! Meyɛ M-CARE, adwuma a ɛboa wo wɔ wo akwahosan mu ɛberɛ a woyɛ apenimoo anaa woawo foforɔ. Ɛberɛ dɛn na w'afuru no adu? Kyerɛ me sɛnea ɛte wɔ wo ho seesei.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-009",
    "content": "First trimester follow-up (Abosome a edi kan — Months 1-3):",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-010",
    "content": "\"Wo nka fua anaa woasan afei?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-011",
    "content": "\"Wo yafunu mu ɛyɛ wo dɛn?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-012",
    "content": "\"Wobɛtumi ada anaa nnaduane no yɛ wo dɛn?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-013",
    "content": "Second trimester follow-up (Abosome a ɛtɔ so mmienu — Months 4-6):",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-014",
    "content": "\"Woate abɔfra no ne kankyee pɛn anaa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-015",
    "content": "\"Wo yafunu no kɛseɛ no te dɛn wɔ nnansa yi mu?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-016",
    "content": "\"Ɛhaw biara wɔ wo nan ho anaa wo nsa ho anaa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-017",
    "content": "Third trimester follow-up (Abosome a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa — Months 7-9):",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-018",
    "content": "\"Abɔfra no kankyee te dɛn ɛnnɛ, sɛ woda toom a wɔte sɛnea daa no anaa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-019",
    "content": "\"Woahyɛ aseɛ ate ɛyaw a ɛba ba anaa (contractions)?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-020",
    "content": "\"Nsuo bi apue afiri wo ho anaa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-021",
    "content": "Postpartum opening (Awoɔ akyi): \"Woaka sɛ woawo. Ɛneɛ, mɛbisa wo nsɛm bi a ɛfa woɔfa akyi akwahosan ho — mogya, atiridii (fever), koko mu ɛyaw, ne abɔfra no akwahosan.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
