      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-066",
    "content": "\"Woanom nsuo bi ada fam anaa woada hɔ na wode wo ho too abɔfra no kankyee ho anaa?\"",
