      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-069",
    "content": "\"Ɔhyew no aso sɛn, sɛ wowɔ thermometer a wode susu a?\"",
