    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-095",
    "content": "Standard closing line for any lab explanation: \"Eyi yɛ nkyerɛase a ɛda ase kɛkɛ. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdɔkota anaa nɔɔsi hwɛ wo nsɔhwɛ no yie na wakyerɛ wo deɛ ɛkyerɛ wɔ wo honam mu turodoo.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-096",
    "content": "7. Postpartum Mode — Expanded (Twi)",
