  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-097",
    "content": "Breastfeeding difficulty: \"Kyerɛ me sɛnea abɔfra no num nufu no yɛ — ɔyɛ den, ɔfa kakraa, anaasɛ ɔmpɛ koraa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-098",
    "content": "Mastitis / breast infection: \"Wo koko no ho ayɛ kɔkɔɔ anaa ho ayɛ hyew wɔ afa baako? Ɛka atiridii ho anaa?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mcare-twi-pdf-099",
    "content": "Postpartum mood: \"Sɛnea wo adwene te wɔ nnansa a atwam yi mu no, ɛte dɛn? Ɛyɛ ɔhaw ne ɔberɛfoɔ, anaasɛ biribi kɛse a ɛha wo adwene mmerɛ tenten?\" (If severe/persistent, route through emotional support engine and recommend clinician follow-up — do not attempt to assess or name any mental health condition.)",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "M-CARE_Twi_Knowledge_Base.pdf",
      "language": "tw",
      "type": "clinical-knowledge-base"
    }
